1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:05,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Meron din pong mga public markets na nalalagay sa panganib na tuluyang magsara

2
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:10,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil sa mga hindi nagtagumpay ng mga privatization o joint venture agreements.

3
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May mga panahon din po na kinakain ng mga malalaking retailers

4
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:20,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang negosyo ng mga maliliit na mga vendors sa ating mga pampublikong palengke.

5
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:24,880
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May panahon din po na lagi pong nalalagay sa question

6
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:28,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang security of tenure ng mga market vendors,

7
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:33,120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung participation mismo nila sa policy sa loob ng mga palengke.

8
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:36,140
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil po sa maraming concerns na yan,

9
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:41,200
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi po ba panahon na para magkaroon halimbawa ng regional consultation

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:46,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o kung ano man sa tingin ng DILG na mainam po na mekanismo

11
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:49,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para marinig yung boses din ng mga market vendors?

12
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:52,680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, Mr. Speaker, there's always a consultation.

13
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:56,120
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And just for the information of our good colleague,

14
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:57,740
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: there was a DILG.

15
00:00:58,060 --> 00:01:02,160
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It's Joint Memorandum Circular No. 2019-01.

16
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:05,780
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: It guides local government units, LGUs,

17
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:12,520
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: in setting just, reasonable, and standardized regulatory fees and service charges.

18
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:16,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor,

19
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:21,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at mangingi po tayo ng pinakahuling ulat ng DILG tungkol dito.

20
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:24,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Nakita rin po kasi natin na sa kapangyarihan ng DILG,

21
00:01:24,620 --> 00:01:28,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: pwede naman po siyang mag-initiate ng iba't ibang program.

22
00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:32,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Halimbawa po, di ba, meron po kayong paleng QRPH program

23
00:01:32,940 --> 00:01:36,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na tumutulong po kayo sa ating mga public markets

24
00:01:36,180 --> 00:01:41,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na magkaroon ng mas maraming opsyon for cashless payments.

25
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:45,800
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Kung nagawa po ito ng DILG na mag-initiate ng ganito mga programa

26
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:48,240
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para tulungan ang ating mga public markets,

27
00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:55,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sana po magkaroon din po tayo ng inisyatiba na nakalapat sa kalagayan ng mga vendors.

28
00:01:55,980 --> 00:01:57,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At sana po kung wala pang konsultasyon,

29
00:01:58,060 --> 00:02:05,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: magkaroon na ng national consultation sa mga LGU, sa ating mga public markets

30
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:08,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para po madinig din natin yung boses ng mga market vendors

31
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:11,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ngayon po ay naghihingalo na ang kanila mga public markets

32
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:17,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at nananawagan po sila na sana may dagdag na suporta ang pambansang pamahalaan

33
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:20,520
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para palakasin ang mga pampublikong merkado sa buong bansa.

34
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:22,140
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Totally agree, Madam Speaker.

35
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:22,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

36
00:02:22,980 --> 00:02:23,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat.

37
00:02:24,140 --> 00:02:27,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At bilang panghuli, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

38
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:30,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: tungkol po sa BJMP cashless system

39
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:37,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ipatupad sa pangmagitan ng Memorandum Circular No. 110.

40
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:43,060
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Narisk ko po ito, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

41
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:47,120
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: dahil meron po tayong mga ulat,

42
00:02:47,820 --> 00:02:55,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: halimbawa na sa ngayon po ba aamiyandahan na po itong cashless system na ito?

43
00:02:56,100 --> 00:02:57,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Magkakaiba po kasi yung...

44
00:02:58,060 --> 00:03:01,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: mga policies, no, kada institution

45
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:06,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na kung paano po natin maipapatupad ng maayos ang cashless system.

46
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:10,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Natanong ko lang po ito dahil sa Bucor, sa CIW,

47
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:12,980
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nagkaroon po ng issue ng nawawalang 6...

48
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:16,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: nasa 6 million pesos, 5 to 6 million pesos.

49
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:21,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At dahil po dito, nais po natin sanang bantayan ng Kongreso

50
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:24,180
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: na ang mga cashless system na ito,

51
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:27,460
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: hindi magkakaroon ng issue ng nawawalang pondo,

52
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:30,400
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: magkakaroon ng issue ng korupsyon,

53
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:36,080
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at hindi po magkakaroon ng issue kung saan napapahirapan po

54
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:40,720
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: o lalong nahihirapan yung mga PDLs na ma-access,

55
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:45,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: yung mga pondo na nararapat lang po ay magamit nila.

56
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:51,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Dahil napakababa na nga po ng ating overhead na expense ng cost,

57
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:58,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kada PDL, at mahirap po kung yung mga pondo na pumapasok,

58
00:03:58,060 --> 00:03:59,740
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kung sa kanila through the cashless system,

59
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:03,680
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ay hindi maayos na ipapatupad at nabibigay sa kanila.

60
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:07,700
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Yes, we totally agree with you, Mr. Speaker.

61
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:11,060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Actually, now may TWG na po na ginagawa,

62
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:14,320
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Technical Working Group, para maisaayos po ito.

63
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:18,260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: At hindi lang po yan, nag-uusap na rin po ang BJMP,

64
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:27,400
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: even ang Bucor, and even po ang Provincial Jail.

65
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:27,980
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Dapat po.

66
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:31,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Nasa isang umbrella na lang para hindi po iba-iba

67
00:04:31,180 --> 00:04:37,060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: yung ating pinapatupad na mga alituntunin para po sa ating jail system.

68
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:40,420
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mr. Speaker, bilang huling katanungan,

69
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:43,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: kailan po matatapos itong pag-amienda,

70
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:46,860
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: itong proseso po ng pagtawag natin ng Technical Working Group,

71
00:04:46,860 --> 00:04:51,340
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: ang consultation para po mas mapalakas ang ating safeguards

72
00:04:51,340 --> 00:04:53,480
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: sa paggamit ng cashless system?

73
00:04:58,060 --> 00:05:02,060
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Madam Speaker, may consultative meeting pa kasing ginagawa.

74
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:07,760
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: But as far as I know, we have to create a law regarding this,

75
00:05:07,860 --> 00:05:09,080
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: kung paano mo pag-iisahin.

76
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:14,840
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: So it's not only we know the problem, we understand it,

77
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:17,420
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and we have to do something about it.

78
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:22,680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: With the advice also of BGMP, even ng Bucor,

79
00:05:23,220 --> 00:05:24,960
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: and ng ating mga Provincial Jails.

80
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:27,300
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

81
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:32,840
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Patuloy nating babantayan ang pagre-repaso ng cashless system na ito

82
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:35,600
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: para sa interest ng transparency ng accountability.

83
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:37,440
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming maraming salamat, Mr. Speaker.

84
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:37,940
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

85
