00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:43,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Monitoring and evaluation of the programs and projects under LGSF.

97
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, hindi kayo yung nag-approve.

