Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: As far as I know, Mr. Speaker.

103
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:55,940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes. Okay.

104
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:56,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So...

105
00:09:56,980 --> 00:09:57,900
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Especially Falgo.

