115
00:10:09,100 --> 00:10:18,980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, we have an idea kung paano yung tinakbo ng LGSF over the past decade from 2016.

116
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:26,280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2016, nasa mga 18.4 billion or 19 billion ng level, GAA.

117
