Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, we note, particularly in 2026.

120
00:10:43,540 --> 00:10:55,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kaya naman po na-focus ang attention dito dahil in 2026 ay relatively mababa yung proposal for LGSF

121
