Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Let's not...

144
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi na masyadong palalaking pa.

145
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:26,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Original proposal dyan, 5 billion.

146
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:31,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Naging 37 billion sa GAA for 2026.

147
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:37,700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos, 2027, same level ang proposal, 37.49 billion.

148
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:38,720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

149
00:12:41,620 --> 00:12:47,820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, malinaw yung pinalobong Local Government Support Fund.

150
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And the next...

151
00:12:51,420 --> 00:12:55,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para lang makita natin yung iba't-ibang components ng Local Government Support Fund,

152
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:58,960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: bukod sa Falgo, yun yung pinakamalaki,

153
