Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nandyan din yung Barangay Development Program ng NTFL-CAC.

154
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:08,660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, it's at 9.7 billion.

155
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:14,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, such things as the Growth Equity Fund and a few others.

156
00:13:14,780 --> 00:13:16,200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero yun yung po yung mga pinakamalaki.

157
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:17,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Now,

158
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang naging kontrobersyal po dito sa...

159
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ah...

160
00:13:23,620 --> 00:13:24,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: particularly financial assistance...

161
