00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:41,900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: was 5 billion lang.

168
00:13:42,140 --> 00:13:42,620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sorry.

169
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:46,760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 18.9 billion.

170
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 18.9 billion.

171
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, malaki na rin yun.

172
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 18.9 billion

173
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:52,840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for 2025.

174
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:53,240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2025.

175
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, doubled.

176
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:58,400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In 2026, 37 billion.

177
00:13:59,360 --> 00:13:59,640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

